                                "sense_id": "5830b5c9-b99e-3d68-b0f8-f8d4efb06c73",
                                "text": "The steelies were just balls of steel, industrially ugly and not part of most girls' collections. There were four sizes of marbles and we called them boulders, biggies, regulars, and teenies."
                            }
                        ]
